* ================================================================
* sky130_cells.lib
* Basic switch cells on SkyWater SKY130 1.8 V devices.
* Include AFTER the PDK library line, e.g.
*   .lib "<sky130A>/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice" tt
*   .include sky130_cells.lib
* Device sizes are in um (the PDK library sets the scale). L = 0.15 um is the 1.8 V minimum.
* The PMOS is 2x the NMOS width (SKY130 hole/electron mobility ratio is about 2.5-3), and the widths
* are parameters so the studies can sweep them.
* ================================================================

* General-purpose inverter.
.subckt INV in out vdd vss wn=1 wp=2 l=0.15
XMP out in vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={wp} l={l}
XMN out in vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={wn} l={l}
.ends INV

* Two-input NAND; series NMOS widened 2x to balance the pull-down.
.subckt NAND2 a b y vdd vss wn=2 wp=2 l=0.15
XMP1 y a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={wp} l={l}
XMP2 y b vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={wp} l={l}
XMN1 y a nx vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={wn} l={l}
XMN2 nx b vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={wn} l={l}
.ends NAND2

* CMOS transmission gate. ON when en = VDD and enb = 0.
.subckt TG a b en enb vdd vss wn=1 wp=2 l=0.15
XMN a en b vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={wn} l={l}
XMP a enb b vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={wp} l={l}
.ends TG

* Single NMOS switch.
.subckt NSW a b en vss wn=1 l=0.15
XMN a en b vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={wn} l={l}
.ends NSW
